system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);"><b>*Limited Run: 100 Studs</b></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1579542085135" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1579542085135"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1643997880630" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643997880630"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);"><span style="font-weight: 700;">The Yin Yang Stud is a small reminder to stay balanced & adventurous.</span></p><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);"><br></p><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);">The dark Yin creates the light Yang and the light Yang creates the dark Yin - they balance each other and show we are all parts of a greater whole.&nbsp;</p><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);"><br></p><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);">At the same time, nothing is stationary. To be balanced is to embrace the change, the unknown, and the adventure that is life.&nbsp;</p><p data-mce-fragment="1" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; text-align: start; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); caret-color: rgb(33, 43, 54);"><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1673506303127" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1673506303127" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/c5b212fc-8035-4c40-8c82-b1979931e8ce/non-scratch%20gif.gif" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="66%" data-hei